      "message": "Compiling without `CONFIG_HOSTCMD_I2C_SLAVE_ADDR` set causes an error:\n\n  chip/max32660/i2c_chip.c:31:17: error: \u0027i2c_bus_irqs\u0027 defined but not used [-Werror\u003dunused-variable]\n   static uint32_t i2c_bus_irqs[] \u003d {EC_I2C0_IRQn, EC_I2C1_IRQn};\n                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n(as the only usage of this variable is inside an `#ifdef CONFIG_HOSTCMD_I2C_SLAVE_ADDR`). This probably needs its own `#ifdef` around the declaration (or to be moved inside the existing one; not sure which style we prefer).",
